{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type to Sleep</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.poster.avif?t=1757010442\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.webm?t=1757010442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.mp4?t=1757010442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help her sleep by typing out her thoughts each night. Every keystroke brings her one step closer to a good night\u2019s rest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Choices Matter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/0acc7f96b37b9938493c96098d8a7537.poster.avif?t=1757010442\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/0acc7f96b37b9938493c96098d8a7537.webm?t=1757010442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/0acc7f96b37b9938493c96098d8a7537.mp4?t=1757010442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before bedtime, you\u2019re presented with a dilemma from work during the day and a few choices to resolve it the next day. Your decisions will affect how easy or difficult bedtime will be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision-based typing game where accuracy and speed matter. The more typos you make or words you miss, the more her stress builds until she can\u2019t sleep at all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extensive vocabulary of everyday words for you to type, helping build your muscle memory. Includes at least 4,000 words, each 3 to 10 characters long.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing lo-fi soundtrack to serenade you as you type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings for every skill level, so you can play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape each night\u2019s difficulty. Dodging your own responsibilities might get you through a stressful night, but helping others makes the path ahead easier.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714440?t=1757010442","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/abc3a1555dde760a0e5fb6a8febf60d178be67f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757010442","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/3a855375b7b827fa15b150c32695c2647fdfb7fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757010442","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/3a855375b7b827fa15b150c32695c2647fdfb7fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757010442","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type to Sleep</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.poster.avif?t=1757010442\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/e